{"v":4,"catch":"附四張獨立桌子的電子遊戲彈珠台！","desc":"《PINBALL ACTION》是 TEHKAN（KOEI TECMO GAMES）於 1985 年推出的彈珠遊戲。\n嘗試清除所有四張桌子上的所有功能，並在遊戲中在它們之間切換！\n使用技巧來搖晃桌子，控制球，抓住任何獲勝的機會！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-04-24","genres":["街機","動作","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b92dcb07ca56998eaf24d903896bef1883196d07cde455ff699bc4c4cd3c3d17.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/252190f59a384d9dc9277df33251b19ade56bdf4b7120297a59df6437e90b743.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e3be087c5dbc13bfbd8443a2c17b738355afaaad9d6f2ad45fc1a72ce9a2f367.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/296517ce772667a2bb7658afe199170a6e581bb5978548026ca1e6101dce3f25.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f1b04dc4f6ec102ae72f98a9b7b08a3aa88f3a55927d28167b71b10c9994d51c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5966b8847e21b9e296d111a7af25f9b239f673516180c887b03d3d5223fa200e.jpg"],"titleId":"010035d02151a000","dlc":[]}